00:08:38.114 --> 00:08:41.150
VERY PROUD OF HER.

00:08:41.151 --> 00:08:42.051
&gt;&gt; Sean: YOU GET THE

00:08:42.052 --> 00:08:43.452
COMPLIMENTS ALL THE TIME.

