00:08:58.668 --> 00:09:01.237
YOU REALLY LOVE THIS.

00:09:01.238 --> 00:09:02.371
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I LOVE

00:09:02.372 --> 00:09:03.205
WHAT WE ARE DOING FOR THE

00:09:03.206 --> 00:09:03.539
COUNTRY.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.441
I LOVE WHAT WE ARE DOING FOR THE

00:09:05.442 --> 00:09:07.243
PEOPLE.

