WE ARE REBUILDING OUR MILITARY.

00:09:08.545 --> 00:09:11.313
THEY WERE TRYING TO GET IT.

00:09:11.314 --> 00:09:12.781
WE ARE DOING A GOOD JOB.

00:09:12.782 --> 00:09:13.716
WE HAVE THE STRONGEST ECONOMY

00:09:13.717 --> 00:09:16.051
WE'VE EVER HAD IN THE HISTORY OF

00:09:16.052 --> 00:09:18.254
