&gt;&gt; Laura: MR. PRESIDENT, THE

00:09:23.894 --> 00:09:26.529
AMERICAN PEOPLE ARE DESPERATE

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:27.062
FOR CALM AND UNITY.

00:09:27.063 --> 00:09:29.231
WHAT MESSAGE I ARE YOU GOING TO

00:09:29.232 --> 00:09:30.599
GIVE THEM AS WE LOOK FORWARD TO

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.701
THE HORIZON OF THE FUTURE IN

00:09:32.702 --> 00:09:34.870
THIS COUNTRY?

00:09:34.871 --> 00:09:36.872
SPEAK THE AMERICAN PEOPLE

00:09:36.873 --> 00:09:37.407
LOOKING FOR CALM AND UNITY

00:09:39.509 --> 00:09:40.442
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I THINK

00:09:40.443 --> 00:09:41.043
SUCCESS WILL DO THAT.

00:09:41.044 --> 00:09:43.612
I THINK WE HAVE TO GET OVER THIS

00:09:43.613 --> 00:09:44.647
