00:09:48.852 --> 00:09:50.953
I THINK SUCCESS -- WE ARE HAVING

00:09:50.954 --> 00:09:52.021
THE MOST SUCCESSFUL TIME

00:09:52.022 --> 00:09:53.455
FINANCIALLY, ECONOMICALLY, THAT

00:09:53.456 --> 00:09:54.256
WE'VE EVER HAD.

00:09:54.257 --> 00:09:55.024
I THINK THAT'S GOING TO BRING A

00:09:55.025 --> 00:09:57.426
